OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy this morning with
OL,6,Fa chance of rain, possibly including
OL,7,Fheavier bursts at times moving
OL,8,Feastwards. Rain clearing by early
OL,9,Fafternoon bringing widespread very
OL,10,Fwarm sunshine to the region and an
OL,11,Fincreasingly humid feel. Winds light
OL,12,For moderate.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FFine and dry this evening. A
OL,15,Fmuggy night to come for most and many
OL,16,Fplaces staying dry overnight, however
OL,17,Fsome patchy rain could reach
OL,18,FLincolnshire and westernmost areas
OL,19,Faround dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
