OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FLargely cloudy through the
OL,6,Fmorning with a chance of early rain
OL,7,Fbut turning brighter by the afternoon.
OL,8,FBands of rain and showers pushing
OL,9,Facross the area overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells and isolated blustery showers
OL,13,FTuesday. Wednesday, mainly dry and
OL,14,Fbright with lighter winds then
OL,15,Fpotentially turning wet and rather
OL,16,Fwindy on Thursday. Temperatures around
OL,17,Faverage for early September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
